                                                    "value": {
                                                        "code": null,
                                                        "comment": "",
                                                        "message": "<p data-end=\"411\" data-start=\"221\">Many industry regulations and compliance frameworks require the implementation of Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA) to protect sensitive data and ensure secure access control. These include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li data-end=\"411\" data-start=\"221\">GDPR (General Data Protection Regulation)</li>\n<li data-end=\"411\" data-start=\"221\">NIST 800-63B (National Institute of Standards and Technology &ndash; Digital Identity Guidelines)</li>\n<li data-end=\"411\" data-start=\"221\">PCI-DSS (Payment Card Industry Data Security Standard)</li>\n<li data-end=\"411\" data-start=\"221\">SOX (Sarbanes-Oxley Act &ndash; Financial Data Protection)</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-end=\"820\" data-start=\"686\">Implementing MFA not only strengthens security but also helps organizations meet regulatory obligations and avoid potential penalties.</p>"
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            },
                                            "slot": "content",
